<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Declares the data structures in which the imported geometry is returned by ASSIMP: <link linkend="_structai_mesh">aiMesh</link>, <link linkend="_structai_face">aiFace</link> and <link linkend="_structai_bone">aiBone</link> data structures. </para>
</section>
