<para><link linkend="_adhed_2assimp_2postprocess_8h_1a64795260b95f5a4b3f3dc1be4f52e410ab4484f73635d633cd79973bac1431ed6">aiProcess_SortByPType</link> Per-primitive sorting of meshes </para>

<para><link linkend="_adhed_2assimp_2postprocess_8h_1a64795260b95f5a4b3f3dc1be4f52e410a9c3de834f0307f31fa2b1b6d05dd592b">aiProcess_Triangulate</link> Automatic triangulation </para>

